      "cooked": "<p>So we know that Tactics will be getting plenty of demo love at GenCon this year. But may I draw your attention to&nbsp;<a href=\"http://boardgamegeek.com/geeklist/161427/item/3287901#item3287901\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://boardgamegeek.com/geeklist/161427/item/3287901#item3287901</a>?</p><p>Specifically, the very last few words. \"<span>Other Information:</span><span> </span><span> • Available for demo games at Gen Con 2014 and possibly on hand for purchase, too.\"</span></p><p><span>Purchase? Really? Be still, my heart, if it's true. I will be quite surprised, but what are the chances?</span></p>",
